WEBVTT

01:30.720 --> 01:34.979
[The Heir]

01:35.420 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 14]

01:41.920 --> 01:42.640
Li Zhen.

01:43.590 --> 01:45.120
Come and take a look at this.

01:56.350 --> 01:57.680
How do you explain this?

01:57.840 --> 01:58.640
Go on then.

02:01.230 --> 02:01.710
This...

02:02.350 --> 02:03.280
By this morning,

02:03.310 --> 02:07.370
the handwritten ink recipe had already
spread throughout Sibao Street.

02:09.150 --> 02:10.750
As for this handwritten ink recipe,

02:10.750 --> 02:12.350
I don't know what's going on—

02:12.360 --> 02:14.460
but it has absolutely nothing
to do with me.

02:14.460 --> 02:17.660
Nothing to do with you?
Then who is it supposed to be about?

02:18.030 --> 02:19.079
Tell us, Li Zhen—

02:19.400 --> 02:21.079
why did you do this?

02:22.079 --> 02:23.750
I restored the lacquer-soot ink myself.

02:23.750 --> 02:25.150
I poured my heart into it.

02:25.400 --> 02:26.750
What would I possibly gain

02:26.750 --> 02:28.350
from leaking the ink recipe?

02:28.520 --> 02:29.720
I'm not stupid enough

02:29.840 --> 02:31.300
to do something like that.

02:33.000 --> 02:33.710
Besides,

02:34.390 --> 02:37.050
I wasn't the only one
who handled the ink recipe.

02:38.150 --> 02:39.710
Uncle Jingdong and Sixth Grandfather

02:39.710 --> 02:41.280
both had access to it as well.

02:41.280 --> 02:42.870
Why am I the only one being suspected?

02:42.870 --> 02:46.200
Because of the things the Eighth Branch
has done in the past.

02:46.630 --> 02:49.630
And now you dare try
to pin this on us, the Sixth Branch?

02:49.710 --> 02:52.120
I dare swear before our ancestors

02:52.120 --> 02:53.120
that I didn't do this.

02:53.120 --> 02:54.470
Do you dare to do the same?

02:54.470 --> 02:55.240
My grandfather swore

02:55.240 --> 02:57.240
before the ancestors back then too.

02:57.870 --> 02:58.930
And what happened?

02:59.870 --> 03:01.400
Didn't you still suspect him
again and again—

03:01.400 --> 03:03.460
along with the entire Eighth Branch?

03:04.400 --> 03:05.360
Uncle Jingdong,

03:06.030 --> 03:07.830
what I don't understand is this:

03:08.000 --> 03:10.240
if you refuse to trust someone
in the first place,

03:10.240 --> 03:11.710
then what good is an oath?

03:13.360 --> 03:14.240
Besides,

03:14.840 --> 03:16.040
we, the Eighth Branch

03:16.280 --> 03:18.750
were removed from the Li family
ancestral hall long ago.

03:18.750 --> 03:20.960
We no longer have anything to do

03:21.120 --> 03:22.520
with the Li family's ancestral tablets.

03:22.520 --> 03:23.960
Listen to her.

03:24.310 --> 03:25.710
She's practically severed
all ties with the Li family—

03:25.710 --> 03:28.000
even denying her own ancestors.

03:28.150 --> 03:29.000
Jiangyue.

03:29.000 --> 03:30.120
Wanyi.

03:31.800 --> 03:33.590
We've treated her quite well,
if you ask me.

03:33.590 --> 03:35.960
We gave her money
and gave her an opportunity,

03:35.960 --> 03:38.079
only for her to repay us with betrayal.

03:38.079 --> 03:40.079
What a fine accusation of betrayal.

03:40.470 --> 03:41.560
Fourth Aunt,

03:41.790 --> 03:44.240
since you're placing
such a serious charge on me,

03:44.240 --> 03:45.680
what evidence

03:46.079 --> 03:47.360
do you have

03:47.630 --> 03:49.590
that I leaked the ink recipe?

03:49.590 --> 03:51.250
What more evidence do we need?

03:51.290 --> 03:52.310
Before you came here,

03:52.310 --> 03:54.910
our family never once
had an ink recipe leaked.

03:55.079 --> 03:55.840
So tell me—

03:55.840 --> 03:57.280
why is it that
ever since you arrived,

03:57.280 --> 03:59.560
the ink workshop has been plagued
by one problem after another?

03:59.560 --> 04:00.490
If it wasn't you,

04:01.030 --> 04:02.430
then who else could it be?

04:02.710 --> 04:03.910
Mother, Wanyi,

04:03.960 --> 04:05.840
I could tell long ago
this girl was up to no good.

04:05.840 --> 04:07.630
We can't take in someone
who'll only turn on us.

04:07.630 --> 04:08.520
Enough.

04:09.960 --> 04:11.090
All of you, be quiet.

04:17.190 --> 04:18.250
This is not the time

04:18.720 --> 04:20.560
to decide who is responsible.

04:21.000 --> 04:23.530
We need to deal with the problem
in front of us.

04:26.720 --> 04:27.430
Jingdong,

04:28.240 --> 04:30.390
contact the ink merchants immediately

04:30.390 --> 04:31.190
and inform them

04:31.190 --> 04:32.190
that the Li family

04:32.510 --> 04:34.800
will provide appropriate compensation.

04:34.800 --> 04:35.510
Yes.

04:36.000 --> 04:36.870
Jinhe,

04:37.630 --> 04:40.000
please also inform
the Literary Association

04:40.000 --> 04:41.920
and Lord Yan.

04:44.830 --> 04:45.600
Zhen,

04:46.480 --> 04:47.680
I believe

04:47.800 --> 04:50.000
you would never do something like this.

04:50.120 --> 04:51.270
Go back for now.

04:51.750 --> 04:52.480
I will

04:52.560 --> 04:54.560
give you an explanation afterward.

04:54.600 --> 04:55.860
Seventh Grandmother,

04:56.070 --> 04:58.950
I cannot leave like this
while my name is still under suspicion.

04:58.950 --> 05:00.280
Since everyone is here,

05:00.600 --> 05:02.260
then let me make myself clear.

05:03.360 --> 05:04.120
First,

05:04.630 --> 05:05.720
I, Li Zhen, took on the restoration

05:05.720 --> 05:08.430
of the ancient lacquer-soot ink
as legitimate paid work.

05:08.430 --> 05:10.360
The Li family owes me nothing, and
I owe the Li family nothing in return.

05:10.360 --> 05:11.120
Second,

05:11.870 --> 05:13.470
I did not leak the ink recipe,

05:13.870 --> 05:15.480
and I will not allow anyone to slander me

05:15.480 --> 05:16.630
as they please.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.560
I will

05:18.750 --> 05:20.390
investigate this matter thoroughly

05:20.390 --> 05:23.000
and expose whoever has been
scheming behind the scenes.

05:23.000 --> 05:24.120
Just wait and see.

05:30.160 --> 05:30.920
Master,

05:31.160 --> 05:31.800
this thing started circulating

05:31.800 --> 05:33.600
from who knows where this morning,

05:33.600 --> 05:35.430
and the Li family is already
in complete chaos because of it.

05:35.430 --> 05:37.830
Miss Li Zhen was so furious
she stormed off.

05:37.830 --> 05:40.230
This is too aggressive
to be a coincidence—

05:40.870 --> 05:43.270
someone must be pulling the strings
behind the scenes.

05:43.270 --> 05:45.360
This concerns our profits from Li Ink.

05:45.360 --> 05:47.430
We can't just sit back
and do nothing, Master.

05:47.430 --> 05:48.120
Xiao Qi,

05:48.390 --> 05:49.790
keep a close eye on things

05:49.870 --> 05:52.600
and report back to me at once
if anything happens.

05:55.870 --> 05:56.870
Manager Shao.

05:57.190 --> 05:58.000
Miss Li Zhen.

05:58.680 --> 05:59.480
I know

06:00.160 --> 06:01.630
you've been wronged.

06:02.560 --> 06:04.120
But the Young Master gave strict orders—

06:04.120 --> 06:05.800
until the matter is fully investigated,

06:05.800 --> 06:07.430
I can't let you into the ink workshop.

06:07.430 --> 06:08.360
Manager Shao,

06:08.430 --> 06:10.760
I'm here because
of the leaked ink recipe.

06:10.870 --> 06:12.130
I do have a favor to ask,

06:12.160 --> 06:13.950
but I promise I won't cause you
any trouble.

06:13.950 --> 06:14.720
What is it?

06:14.920 --> 06:17.170
I'd like to borrow the employment records

06:17.170 --> 06:19.370
of the Li's Ink Workshop over the years.

06:27.600 --> 06:30.040
Manager Shao, you really have
kept the employment records

06:30.040 --> 06:32.510
of Li's Ink Workshop

06:32.600 --> 06:34.800
impeccably organized all these years.

06:34.920 --> 06:37.270
Every worker at Li Ink

06:37.600 --> 06:39.720
has their arrival and departure times

06:39.720 --> 06:41.120
clearly recorded.

06:42.830 --> 06:43.750
Miss Li Zhen,

06:44.240 --> 06:47.310
these are only employment records
for the ink workshop.

06:47.310 --> 06:49.750
What insight could you
possibly gain from them?

06:49.750 --> 06:50.600
Manager Shao,

06:51.070 --> 06:53.400
look at the handwriting
on the ink recipe.

06:54.390 --> 06:55.950
The person who copied it

06:55.950 --> 06:57.350
has a distinctive habit:

06:57.950 --> 06:59.390
when writing horizontal strokes,

06:59.390 --> 07:01.120
they always slant them upward,

07:01.270 --> 07:02.750
and when writing vertical strokes,

07:02.750 --> 07:04.750
they never return the brush upward.

07:05.600 --> 07:06.680
And on these employment records,

07:06.680 --> 07:08.270
every ink-maker wrote down

07:08.310 --> 07:10.040
their own name personally.

07:10.430 --> 07:11.130
That's why

07:11.390 --> 07:14.720
I want to track this person down
through their handwriting.

07:14.750 --> 07:16.610
Miss Li Zhen, you're quite sharp.

07:17.600 --> 07:18.920
But how can you be sure

07:19.270 --> 07:20.800
the person who copied the ink recipe

07:20.800 --> 07:22.120
once worked at Li Ink?

07:22.390 --> 07:24.000
Whoever leaked the ink recipe

07:24.000 --> 07:26.400
must be connected
to the Li's Ink Workshop.

07:26.600 --> 07:28.360
I'm not completely certain,

07:28.950 --> 07:30.600
but to clear my name,

07:30.920 --> 07:32.800
I can only try my best.

08:23.600 --> 08:24.430
Manager Shao,

08:24.430 --> 08:26.030
come quickly and take a look.

08:27.680 --> 08:29.340
I think I've found the person.

08:31.490 --> 08:33.770
[Ge Laoliu]

08:32.380 --> 08:33.620
I remember him.

08:33.909 --> 08:34.549
Five years ago,

08:34.549 --> 08:36.200
the ink workshop hired him.

08:36.480 --> 08:38.000
He worked in the lampblack-making workshop
for less than half a month.

08:38.000 --> 08:40.669
He repeatedly cut corners
and passed off inferior goods,

08:40.669 --> 08:42.000
so I kicked him out.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.480
Zhen,

08:45.200 --> 08:46.320
this Ge Laoliu

08:46.550 --> 08:48.630
is a notorious scoundrel on this street.

08:48.630 --> 08:50.270
He's in debt to every restaurant

08:50.270 --> 08:51.690
and tavern on this street.

08:51.690 --> 08:52.950
He's definitely here.

08:56.630 --> 08:57.720
Nice!

08:57.910 --> 08:58.910
Over there.

09:02.270 --> 09:03.030
Waiter,

09:04.150 --> 09:05.030
more wine.

09:06.630 --> 09:07.870
No money, no wine.

09:08.080 --> 09:08.840
What money?

09:09.790 --> 09:12.050
I'll kick you to death—do you believe it?

09:13.390 --> 09:14.080
Remember this—

09:14.080 --> 09:15.720
wait until you're somewhere
with fewer people before making a move.

09:15.720 --> 09:17.720
Knock him out, then tie him up.

09:17.750 --> 09:19.150
Don't fight him head-on.

09:19.150 --> 09:19.840
Zhen,

09:20.030 --> 09:21.510
don't show yourself.
Go back to the old ink workshop and wait.

09:21.510 --> 09:22.600
I'll bring him to you.

09:22.600 --> 09:23.720
Hurry, hurry, Ge Laoliu is leaving!

09:23.720 --> 09:24.240
Alright.

09:24.240 --> 09:25.150
Quick, quick.

09:29.000 --> 09:29.930
Watch yourself.

09:47.960 --> 09:48.870
Don't touch me!

10:03.960 --> 10:05.480
W-What's going on, buddy?

10:06.150 --> 10:07.150
Cut the nonsense!

10:18.320 --> 10:19.670
I'll beat you to death!

10:25.670 --> 10:26.840
Don't come any closer.

10:26.840 --> 10:27.630
Don't come any closer!

10:27.630 --> 10:30.320
Weapons have no eyes! Weapons
have no eyes! Weapons have no eyes!

10:30.320 --> 10:30.600
Zhengliang!

10:30.600 --> 10:31.510
Weapons have no eyes!

10:31.510 --> 10:32.310
Hit him, Zhen!

10:38.080 --> 10:39.010
Don't come over.

10:39.080 --> 10:39.720
Don't come over.

10:39.720 --> 10:40.320
Don't—

10:44.080 --> 10:45.940
How can you bully a girl like that?

10:57.750 --> 10:59.010
He's still breathing.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.440
I was too rough.

11:01.510 --> 11:02.440
Are you alright?

11:03.080 --> 11:04.000
Master Qi,

11:05.200 --> 11:06.270
w-why are you here?

11:07.080 --> 11:08.680
Your "Weapons have no eyes!"

11:09.440 --> 11:10.900
echoed through the skies!

11:15.630 --> 11:16.360
Zhengliang,

11:16.840 --> 11:17.480
are you alright?

11:17.480 --> 11:18.870
Did he hit your stomach?

11:19.200 --> 11:20.080
I'm fine, I'm fine.

11:20.080 --> 11:20.880
Just a little.

11:21.600 --> 11:22.440
No cuts, right?

11:22.440 --> 11:23.320
No, no, mo.

11:24.440 --> 11:25.240
Miss Li Zhen…

11:26.120 --> 11:26.840
this...

11:29.670 --> 11:30.470
this is yours?

11:31.150 --> 11:32.010
Yes, it's mine.

11:33.120 --> 11:34.080
You're better suited to making ink.

11:34.080 --> 11:35.120
Here,

11:35.510 --> 11:36.840
keep this knife for now.

11:36.840 --> 11:37.700
How about this—

11:38.360 --> 11:39.760
he leaked the ink recipe.

11:39.870 --> 11:41.270
Since I'm also a part-owner,

11:41.270 --> 11:43.240
I'll take care of him from here.

11:43.830 --> 11:44.510
Wait.

11:45.120 --> 11:47.480
Master Qi, I know you mean well,

11:47.720 --> 11:49.120
but it's because of this man

11:49.120 --> 11:51.030
that I was falsely accused
by the Li family.

11:51.030 --> 11:51.840
So

11:51.960 --> 11:53.820
I have to interrogate him myself.

11:56.910 --> 11:57.770
That works too.

11:58.000 --> 11:58.960
At least

11:59.440 --> 12:01.040
let me carry him back for you.

12:03.090 --> 12:03.910
Thanks a lot.

12:04.080 --> 12:04.870
Thank you.

12:12.440 --> 12:13.840
That's a lot of strength…

12:21.440 --> 12:22.440
Xiao Qi,

12:22.720 --> 12:24.750
could I borrow your blade?

12:27.960 --> 12:29.170
This is my master's blade.

12:29.170 --> 12:30.970
Miss Li Zhen, feel free to use it.

12:31.880 --> 12:32.810
Thanks a lot.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.480
Thank you.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.320
Zhengliang, let's go.

12:35.320 --> 12:37.360
What did I just tell you?

12:46.120 --> 12:47.000
Ge Laoliu,

12:48.870 --> 12:49.960
sober now?

12:50.870 --> 12:52.750
Open your eyes and look closely—

12:53.510 --> 12:54.720
do you know who I am?

12:58.480 --> 12:59.270
You're…

13:00.030 --> 13:02.560
that girl who restored
the lacquer-soot ink?

13:03.780 --> 13:04.630
That's right.

13:06.030 --> 13:06.990
That's me.

13:07.750 --> 13:09.390
I've never seen you

13:09.390 --> 13:11.190
at the Li's Ink Workshop before.

13:12.120 --> 13:12.790
Master,

13:13.810 --> 13:14.840
isn't interrogation

13:14.840 --> 13:16.480
our specialty?

13:16.750 --> 13:17.750
They're actually doing it themselves?

13:17.750 --> 13:19.390
You scared me—
I thought it was someone big.

13:19.390 --> 13:20.920
This is a rare opportunity.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.780
Let them have their fun first.

13:22.910 --> 13:23.630
I'm telling you—

13:23.630 --> 13:24.550
I'll go take another look.

13:24.550 --> 13:25.840
Don't you come at me

13:26.150 --> 13:27.910
with that "head of the house" attitude!

13:27.910 --> 13:29.360
A woman

13:29.450 --> 13:31.380
should stay at home,

13:31.480 --> 13:33.080
serve her man properly.

13:33.360 --> 13:34.960
Always running around in public—

13:34.960 --> 13:36.030
aren't you ashamed?

13:36.030 --> 13:37.080
Watch your mouth!

13:37.080 --> 13:38.390
I-I'll say it anyway.

13:39.870 --> 13:42.440
You still want to fight men for power?

13:43.230 --> 13:44.160
I'm telling you,

13:44.360 --> 13:45.240
I'll make you

13:45.960 --> 13:48.030
drop that idea sooner rather than later.

13:48.030 --> 13:50.390
Stop filling your head with nonsense.

13:52.330 --> 13:53.060
Hit him!

13:55.390 --> 13:57.670
Master, that guy's hitting him—

13:59.360 --> 14:00.510
he's got quite a bit of strength.

14:00.510 --> 14:02.370
Let him practice his skills a bit.

14:07.080 --> 14:08.200
Ge Laoliu,

14:08.440 --> 14:11.500
do you think saying things like that
will make me angry?

14:13.440 --> 14:15.240
I'm not angry at all.

14:15.790 --> 14:16.910
Your words

14:16.930 --> 14:19.840
have actually made things
a little clearer in my mind.

14:19.840 --> 14:22.120
Looks like your mole at the Li family

14:22.480 --> 14:24.120
hasn't stopped whispering

14:24.120 --> 14:24.960
in your ear.

14:25.670 --> 14:27.120
The more you insult me,

14:27.320 --> 14:29.200
the more it proves
how outstanding I am—

14:29.200 --> 14:31.080
you just can't compare to me.

14:31.870 --> 14:33.270
So if you know what's good for you,

14:33.270 --> 14:34.670
you'd better confess right now

14:34.670 --> 14:35.750
who your mole in the Li family is.

14:35.750 --> 14:37.360
I, Ge Laoliu,

14:38.840 --> 14:40.240
don't know what's good for me.

14:40.240 --> 14:42.240
Don't know what's good for you, huh?

14:42.390 --> 14:43.990
Alright, alright, alright.

14:44.240 --> 14:45.510
That mole of yours

14:45.630 --> 14:47.550
must have paid you a good sum of silver

14:47.550 --> 14:48.550
and promised you

14:48.630 --> 14:50.120
a bright future

14:50.360 --> 14:52.160
once this whole mess blows over.

14:52.390 --> 14:54.630
But now that everything's out
in the open,

14:54.630 --> 14:56.030
if you don't confess,

14:56.360 --> 14:58.000
I'll turn you over to the authorities.

14:58.000 --> 14:59.480
We'll see

14:59.630 --> 15:01.960
who dares to protect

15:01.960 --> 15:04.320
a useless pawn like you.

15:04.550 --> 15:05.610
Trying to scare me?

15:06.600 --> 15:08.320
You've got no proof.

15:09.200 --> 15:10.130
That ink recipe?

15:10.440 --> 15:12.600
I picked it up on the street—that's all.

15:12.600 --> 15:14.330
What can the officials do to me?

15:15.000 --> 15:16.360
Besides, once this blows over,

15:16.360 --> 15:18.780
I'll be perfectly fine
and come out unscathed.

15:18.780 --> 15:20.090
Perfectly fine?

15:24.030 --> 15:25.630
Sounds like your mole

15:25.630 --> 15:27.440
only told you half the truth.

15:27.910 --> 15:29.440
You haven't grasped the key secret

15:29.440 --> 15:31.640
of the ancient lacquer-soot ink at all.

15:40.630 --> 15:41.320
Master,

15:42.120 --> 15:43.380
she's drawn the blade.

15:47.150 --> 15:48.290
Take a look at this.

15:48.620 --> 15:51.530
[Qi]

15:54.200 --> 15:56.360
Qi… Qi… Qi…

15:56.390 --> 15:57.190
That's right.

15:58.270 --> 15:59.670
It stands for Marshal Qi.

16:00.550 --> 16:02.150
The owner of this blade

16:03.090 --> 16:05.210
is Qi Jiu,

16:05.630 --> 16:06.960
the master of Yihousheng.

16:06.960 --> 16:08.910
This technique is a bit crude.

16:09.440 --> 16:10.630
Very crude.

16:10.840 --> 16:11.910
This Qi Jiu—

16:12.750 --> 16:14.350
he's one of Marshal Qi's men.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.910
When Master Qi first came to Huizhou,

16:17.910 --> 16:19.710
his very first business venture

16:19.910 --> 16:23.030
was partnering with the Li family
on the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

16:23.030 --> 16:24.120
But now,

16:24.360 --> 16:26.440
by spreading that ink recipe around,

16:26.600 --> 16:28.670
you've made it impossible to produce
the ancient lacquer-soot ink.

16:28.670 --> 16:29.910
This doesn't

16:30.360 --> 16:31.820
just affect the Li family—

16:32.000 --> 16:34.000
it also hits Master Qi's interests.

16:35.120 --> 16:36.630
And Master Qi?

16:37.240 --> 16:38.960
He's ruthless and cold-blooded,

16:38.960 --> 16:40.510
kills without mercy,

16:40.560 --> 16:42.840
and he's certainly not
as easy to deal with as I am.

16:42.840 --> 16:44.320
Right now, Master Qi

16:44.720 --> 16:45.930
is behind that door.

16:47.120 --> 16:48.480
If you stubbornly fall into his hands…

16:48.480 --> 16:49.790
there will be blood.

16:50.390 --> 16:52.440
there will be bloodshed.

16:52.440 --> 16:54.440
Sun Baiyi.

16:56.030 --> 16:56.890
Go on.

17:00.890 --> 17:03.600
It was Sun Baiyi
who gave me the ink recipe.

17:05.690 --> 17:08.250
I really didn't expect it—

17:08.550 --> 17:09.880
I could perform so well.

17:10.310 --> 17:12.640
He caved in immediately when questioned.

17:12.920 --> 17:13.589
Of course,

17:13.640 --> 17:14.920
Master Qi's blade

17:14.920 --> 17:16.069
helped me a lot.

17:16.750 --> 17:18.410
This blade is really amazing!

17:18.440 --> 17:19.790
This blade,

17:20.200 --> 17:23.200
in your hands,
was used with remarkable skill—

17:23.270 --> 17:24.589
and your story

17:24.589 --> 17:26.480
was told with equal brilliance.

17:28.440 --> 17:31.030
I had no choice.

17:31.070 --> 17:32.720
To make him tell the truth,

17:32.720 --> 17:34.200
I had to make things up.

17:34.240 --> 17:35.640
"Make things up"?

17:36.270 --> 17:37.270
This blade

17:37.440 --> 17:39.440
is a military saber from the Qi Army.

17:43.030 --> 17:43.920
So… you've actually

17:43.920 --> 17:45.830
killed people with it?

18:09.700 --> 18:10.830
He's teasing you.

18:16.720 --> 18:19.050
Ge Laoliu mentioned a guy named Sun Baiyi—

18:20.000 --> 18:21.600
Miss Li Zhen, do you know him?

18:22.640 --> 18:24.170
More than just knowing him—

18:24.270 --> 18:25.440
he's my sworn enemy

18:26.070 --> 18:27.800
and has always been against me.

18:27.830 --> 18:28.880
He's a cousin

18:29.000 --> 18:30.440
of my eldest aunt.

18:30.920 --> 18:33.240
I guess he's worried
that me staying long in the Li family

18:33.240 --> 18:34.440
will get in the way
of his family's attempt

18:34.440 --> 18:36.110
to use Zhengyou to climb higher.

18:36.110 --> 18:37.880
I'll keep Ge Laoliu in custody
for you for now.

18:37.880 --> 18:40.350
So, what's your plan next, Miss Li Zhen?

18:40.350 --> 18:41.400
What else can I do?

18:41.720 --> 18:43.160
Naturally, I'll clear my name

18:43.160 --> 18:44.420
openly and honorably.

18:45.310 --> 18:46.680
If you need help,

18:46.830 --> 18:48.960
don't hesitate to come to the two of us.

18:52.920 --> 18:53.680
Aunt Rujun,

18:54.480 --> 18:56.540
Baiyi grew up right under your watch.

18:56.640 --> 18:58.960
His father, Sun Dahe, has also been

18:58.960 --> 19:00.640
a long-time worker at Li Ink.

19:01.790 --> 19:03.200
I simply cannot believe

19:03.200 --> 19:04.930
he would be the one behind this.

19:06.750 --> 19:09.610
There's definitely
something fishy going on here.

19:09.640 --> 19:11.750
Maybe some outsiders

19:11.960 --> 19:13.620
are trying to stir up trouble.

19:14.400 --> 19:15.680
If witnesses aren't enough,

19:15.680 --> 19:17.540
I have physical evidence as well.

19:18.960 --> 19:20.200
Seventh Grandmother,

19:20.200 --> 19:21.310
this is the original draft
of the ink recipe

19:21.310 --> 19:22.970
that Sun Baiyi gave Ge Laoliu.

19:26.880 --> 19:27.960
Manager Shao.

19:32.920 --> 19:34.780
This is Sun Baiyi's handwriting.

19:39.070 --> 19:39.960
Go.

19:40.270 --> 19:42.000
Arrest him at the ink workshop!

19:52.680 --> 19:53.510
Wanyi.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.550
Jiangyue.

19:55.920 --> 19:57.000
After all,

19:57.000 --> 19:59.070
Sun Baiyi is your paternal cousin,

19:59.680 --> 20:02.270
and he has always been
quite close to Zhengyou.

20:02.270 --> 20:04.070
Right now Mother is so angry—

20:04.640 --> 20:07.170
if you, as the elder sister,
don't intervene,

20:07.590 --> 20:10.200
the punishment will probably be severe.

20:12.030 --> 20:13.760
He's really making me furious.

20:15.480 --> 20:16.960
How could he

20:17.640 --> 20:20.400
do something so utterly reckless?

20:21.440 --> 20:22.440
At this point,

20:23.160 --> 20:24.160
I'm afraid

20:24.350 --> 20:26.270
only Master Sun can save him.

20:26.920 --> 20:28.030
Whatever the case,

20:28.270 --> 20:30.240
Sun Baiyi is still Master Sun's

20:30.240 --> 20:31.480
only son.

20:32.110 --> 20:32.920
Yes.

20:34.550 --> 20:36.210
I'll go find Uncle right away.

20:50.270 --> 20:52.640
Go gather all of Master Sun's

20:52.640 --> 20:54.110
apprentices for me.

21:01.960 --> 21:02.890
Kneel properly.

21:03.400 --> 21:04.240
Old Madam.

21:09.750 --> 21:11.610
This is a duplicate key

21:11.630 --> 21:13.790
to the warehouse
that we found on Sun Baiyi.

21:13.790 --> 21:16.310
The witnesses and evidence
are all in order.

21:18.030 --> 21:18.510
I...

21:23.200 --> 21:24.860
I won't do it again, Old Madam!

21:24.920 --> 21:26.180
Old Madam, I was wrong!

21:26.270 --> 21:27.960
Old Madam, I'll never do it again!

21:27.960 --> 21:29.680
I know I was wrong, Old Madam!

21:30.030 --> 21:30.880
Old Madam! Old Madam!

21:30.880 --> 21:31.880
Silence.

21:33.920 --> 21:36.960
For centuries,
the Li Ink has always placed

21:37.510 --> 21:40.590
integrity and trust above all else,
both within and outside the family.

21:40.590 --> 21:42.790
You've committed such a grave offense—

21:42.960 --> 21:44.690
if we do not punish it severely,

21:45.790 --> 21:47.350
how can we uphold the principles

21:47.350 --> 21:49.480
of "upright and honorable"?

21:53.200 --> 21:54.350
Manager Shao,

21:54.790 --> 21:57.550
the ink workshop rules
are clearly written

21:58.110 --> 22:00.030
and laid out.

22:00.830 --> 22:02.310
What should be done—

22:02.880 --> 22:03.720
tell us.

22:04.920 --> 22:06.250
Reporting to Old Madam,

22:07.350 --> 22:10.480
ink recipes are
not only the foundation of our trade,

22:10.790 --> 22:13.400
but also affect the livelihood
and future of all ink-makers.

22:13.400 --> 22:14.720
Sun Baiyi's actions

22:14.830 --> 22:17.270
constitute grave disloyalty
and injustice.

22:17.270 --> 22:18.790
According to the rules
of the Li's Ink Workshop,

22:18.790 --> 22:20.200
all his earnings should be confiscated,

22:20.200 --> 22:22.160
both his hands severed,
and he should be expelled from

22:22.160 --> 22:24.160
the workshop as a warning to others.

22:24.480 --> 22:25.550
Take him away.

22:28.070 --> 22:29.070
Old Madam!

22:32.310 --> 22:33.310
Old Madam...

22:34.110 --> 22:37.270
I beg you—let me take my son's punishment.

22:37.480 --> 22:38.030
Old Madam.

22:38.030 --> 22:38.640
Father…

22:39.680 --> 22:40.960
I am unfilial...

22:42.070 --> 22:43.000
I am unfilial...

22:46.320 --> 22:49.580
When a son is not taught properly,
it is the father's fault.

22:50.240 --> 22:52.440
My son has committed a monstrous crime,

22:53.920 --> 22:55.590
and as his father,

22:55.590 --> 22:57.640
I cannot escape responsibility.

22:59.160 --> 23:00.790
I am

23:01.510 --> 23:03.160
willing to take the punishment

23:03.160 --> 23:06.400
of having my hands severed
in Baiyi's place.

23:09.070 --> 23:10.200
Master Sun,

23:11.270 --> 23:12.960
don't say such things.

23:13.960 --> 23:16.400
This has nothing to do with you.

23:16.590 --> 23:17.790
Old Madam,

23:18.830 --> 23:21.480
I only have one son…

23:22.440 --> 23:24.640
Though he is unworthy,

23:25.640 --> 23:27.350
how can a father

23:28.590 --> 23:32.270
bear to watch his son
have his hands severed?

23:33.590 --> 23:36.400
Please grant my request, Old Madam.

23:38.720 --> 23:39.550
Old Madam,

23:40.310 --> 23:41.110
Master Li Liu,

23:41.640 --> 23:43.960
we came here to speak up

23:43.960 --> 23:45.440
for Master Sun.

23:45.920 --> 23:48.720
He has worked diligently
for the Li family for decades

23:48.720 --> 23:50.440
and has made great contributions.

23:50.440 --> 23:53.030
Since old times, it has been a principle
that a father's debt is repaid by the son,

23:53.030 --> 23:54.790
and a father's kindness
is inherited by the son.

23:54.790 --> 23:57.720
Even nobles in the capital,
when they commit crimes,

23:57.750 --> 23:59.640
are often spared harsh punishment

23:59.640 --> 24:01.040
due to ancestral merits.

24:01.200 --> 24:03.550
We beg you, Old Madam, to show mercy

24:03.680 --> 24:04.720
and spare

24:05.160 --> 24:06.830
the hand-severing punishment.

24:06.830 --> 24:09.590
We beg Old Madam for mercy.

24:11.590 --> 24:14.960
Everyone in the Li's Ink Workshop

24:16.310 --> 24:19.000
must always keep the words
"Upright and Honorable"

24:19.000 --> 24:20.680
engraved in their hearts.

24:21.000 --> 24:21.960
Rujun,

24:23.030 --> 24:25.400
they do have a point.

24:26.240 --> 24:29.200
After the Tribute Ink case back then,

24:30.160 --> 24:31.720
many ink workshops offered Master Sun

24:31.720 --> 24:35.070
large sums to hire him away,

24:35.640 --> 24:37.000
but he refused them all.

24:37.750 --> 24:38.880
And all these years,

24:39.200 --> 24:41.860
it's thanks to him
keeping the glue room running

24:42.200 --> 24:44.530
that Li Ink's production was maintained.

24:48.480 --> 24:50.880
Mother, Baiyi is my paternal cousin.

24:51.110 --> 24:52.770
He committed a grave mistake,

24:52.830 --> 24:54.880
and by all rights I should not interfere.

24:54.880 --> 24:56.310
But I ask

24:56.960 --> 24:58.880
that you consider how Master Sun

24:58.880 --> 25:01.340
has devoted most of his life
to the Li family.

25:01.350 --> 25:03.010
He's already advanced in age.

25:03.110 --> 25:05.790
Mother, I hope you can show leniency.

25:10.070 --> 25:11.200
Wanyi,

25:12.030 --> 25:13.000
get up.

25:14.030 --> 25:14.640
Mother.

25:19.550 --> 25:20.550
Zhen,

25:21.790 --> 25:24.160
you've suffered the most because of this.

25:25.030 --> 25:28.350
What punishment do you think
is appropriate?

25:33.310 --> 25:35.000
Since the family and workshop rules

25:35.000 --> 25:36.240
are clearly written,

25:37.160 --> 25:39.510
a father cannot
take the punishment for his son.

25:39.510 --> 25:41.720
But I will never forget
the kindness Eldest Aunt

25:41.720 --> 25:43.200
has shown me

25:43.830 --> 25:46.680
and the Eighth Branch.

25:50.480 --> 25:52.350
The hand-severing punishment
may be spared,

25:52.350 --> 25:54.680
but the rest of the punishment
cannot be avoided.

25:54.680 --> 25:56.240
I trust Seventh Grandmother

25:56.240 --> 25:57.970
will give me a fair resolution.

26:01.440 --> 26:02.160
Very well.

26:04.030 --> 26:06.550
The hand-severing punishment
will be reduced to flogging.

26:06.550 --> 26:09.790
From today onward, Baiyi and his father
are expelled from the ink workshop

26:09.790 --> 26:11.520
and shall never be hired again.

26:12.000 --> 26:14.750
Thank you, Old Madam, for your mercy!

26:15.030 --> 26:17.270
Thank you, Old Madam, for your mercy!

26:17.270 --> 26:18.070
Disperse.

26:18.070 --> 26:18.720
Wait.

26:20.590 --> 26:23.720
Sun Baiyi caused a great disaster
and should be punished,

26:23.720 --> 26:26.480
but I believe the real culprit
is someone else.

26:26.680 --> 26:28.880
The person who most deserves
to be expelled from the ink workshop

26:28.880 --> 26:29.920
is her,

26:30.070 --> 26:30.880
Li Zhen.

26:33.070 --> 26:34.070
Jiangyue,

26:34.160 --> 26:35.400
stop talking nonsense.

26:35.400 --> 26:36.680
I am not talking nonsense.

26:36.680 --> 26:38.200
This is ridiculous.

26:38.720 --> 26:39.680
Somehow, the victim

26:39.680 --> 26:42.110
has become the culprit in your eyes.

26:42.960 --> 26:44.030
Fourth Aunt,

26:44.640 --> 26:46.240
I really want to ask—

26:46.590 --> 26:47.850
what have I done wrong?

26:48.070 --> 26:50.270
You made one successful ink stick

26:50.270 --> 26:52.510
and suddenly started looking down
on everyone else.

26:52.510 --> 26:55.200
Rules and reason should still
leave room for human feeling.

26:55.200 --> 26:58.110
Today, so many people pleaded for Baiyi,

26:58.350 --> 27:00.720
yet you alone refused
to let the matter rest.

27:00.720 --> 27:02.590
In front of everyone,

27:02.680 --> 27:04.590
you pressured your seventh grandmother

27:04.590 --> 27:06.750
into ruling in your favor,
disregarding the bigger picture entirely.

27:06.750 --> 27:09.210
You are truly cold-hearted and ungrateful.

27:09.400 --> 27:11.750
The very first lesson I learned
at the Li's Ink Workshop

27:11.750 --> 27:13.920
was that without rules,
there can be no order.

27:13.920 --> 27:15.310
A wrong is still a wrong.

27:15.750 --> 27:17.010
No amount of sentiment

27:17.070 --> 27:18.790
should blur the line
between right and wrong.

27:18.790 --> 27:19.550
Otherwise,

27:19.750 --> 27:22.240
what is the point of having family rules
and workshop rules at all?

27:22.240 --> 27:23.110
If we were truly
following the family rules,

27:23.110 --> 27:24.750
you shouldn't even be here.

27:25.240 --> 27:27.310
You were expelled
from the clan in disgrace,

27:27.310 --> 27:28.440
yet instead of staying in line,

27:28.440 --> 27:30.500
you're scheming with wild ambition.

27:30.510 --> 27:32.750
Why do you think Sun Baiyi
stole the recipe?

27:32.750 --> 27:35.160
If you hadn't been coveting
the Li Ink business

27:35.160 --> 27:37.490
and scheming to seize power and property,

27:37.680 --> 27:38.750
why would he risk committing such a crime

27:38.750 --> 27:40.830
just to protect Zhengyou's position

27:40.920 --> 27:42.960
as heir?

27:43.920 --> 27:45.520
To seize power and property?

27:45.830 --> 27:47.240
If you want to go after me,

27:47.350 --> 27:49.610
then go ahead—no need to throw dirt on me.

27:49.920 --> 27:51.350
Anyone with eyes can see clearly.

27:51.350 --> 27:52.240
I believe

27:52.350 --> 27:54.160
justice lives in people's hearts.

27:54.160 --> 27:56.480
If you truly had no intention
of seizing power and property,

27:56.480 --> 27:58.440
then after restoring
the ancient lacquer-soot ink,

27:58.440 --> 28:01.110
why insist on shamelessly
staying at the Li's Ink Workshop?

28:01.110 --> 28:03.640
Weren't you trying to take over Li Ink

28:03.640 --> 28:04.590
and become the head of the Li family?

28:04.590 --> 28:05.450
Tian Jiangyue,

28:05.830 --> 28:07.720
stop trying to drive a wedge
between people.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.960
Never once have I had such intentions.

28:10.030 --> 28:11.880
Right now, you haven't
secured your footing yet,

28:11.880 --> 28:14.680
so naturally you wouldn't
reveal your ambitions.

28:14.720 --> 28:16.270
But what about a year from now?

28:16.270 --> 28:17.310
And Two years?

28:17.480 --> 28:19.200
And Three years?

28:20.880 --> 28:21.680
Wanyi,

28:22.270 --> 28:23.640
Li Zhen is refusing to leave.

28:23.640 --> 28:24.640
Even if you don't say it out loud,

28:24.640 --> 28:26.270
you must feel upset inside.

28:27.030 --> 28:28.750
Open your eyes and see clearly.

28:28.750 --> 28:31.110
Don't let this villain trick you.

28:31.110 --> 28:33.480
Tian Jiangyue, stop talking nonsense.

28:33.590 --> 28:35.310
I have never once
thought that way about Zhen.

28:35.310 --> 28:37.680
Wanyi, since you refuse to say it,

28:38.070 --> 28:40.920
let me be the villain

28:41.070 --> 28:42.480
for you and Zhengyou.

28:41.340 --> 28:43.990
[Seventh Branch's Legitimate Grandson:
Li Zhengyou, Son of Sun Wanyi]

28:44.680 --> 28:46.000
Believe it or not,

28:46.270 --> 28:48.240
if Li Zhen stays today,

28:48.440 --> 28:50.720
then once she gains power
and takes control of the family assets,

28:50.720 --> 28:54.350
the ones driven out in the future
will be Wanyi and Zhengyou.

28:54.350 --> 28:55.240
Tian Jiangyue,

28:55.640 --> 28:57.310
stop spewing nonsense.

28:57.790 --> 28:58.550
Eldest Aunt.

28:58.550 --> 28:59.200
Zhen.

28:59.400 --> 29:00.240
Zhengyou,

29:01.240 --> 29:02.680
how could you hit your sister?

29:02.680 --> 29:04.030
She's not my sister.

29:04.640 --> 29:06.400
Mother, this is our home.

29:06.510 --> 29:08.030
No one gets to drive us out.

29:08.480 --> 29:09.400
Bastard!

29:10.070 --> 29:11.420
How could you speak like that?

29:11.420 --> 29:13.280
Who taught you to speak like that?

29:13.480 --> 29:14.340
Go back inside.

29:15.400 --> 29:16.400
Take him away.

29:19.160 --> 29:19.830
Mother.

29:20.720 --> 29:22.110
For the harmony of the Li family,

29:22.110 --> 29:23.590
and for the preservation of Li Ink,

29:23.590 --> 29:24.310
Li Zhen

29:24.480 --> 29:26.920
must not remain at the Li's Ink Workshop.

29:27.070 --> 29:28.440
Wherever she came from,

29:28.750 --> 29:30.680
send her back there.

29:30.920 --> 29:31.830
Old Madam,

29:31.920 --> 29:34.030
please expel Li Zhen
from the Li's Ink Workshop.

29:34.030 --> 29:37.440
That's right! Throw her out!
Get her out of here!

29:37.440 --> 29:38.110
Enough!

29:40.310 --> 29:41.550
Silence, all of you!

29:53.750 --> 29:55.010
Seventh Grandmother,

29:55.590 --> 29:57.520
you needn't feel upset for my sake.

29:57.920 --> 29:59.650
Since things have come to this,

30:00.350 --> 30:01.400
I may

30:02.720 --> 30:03.880
as well

30:04.400 --> 30:06.660
say everything clearly once and for all.

30:09.480 --> 30:12.550
From the day I began
restoring ancient lacquer-soot ink

30:12.550 --> 30:15.750
to the truth behind
the leaked ink recipe coming to light,

30:16.110 --> 30:19.310
I, Li Zhen, have never done anything
to betray the Li family.

30:19.310 --> 30:20.830
I came here for the craft of ink-making,

30:20.830 --> 30:22.090
openly and honorably.

30:22.790 --> 30:23.830
Never once did I intend

30:23.830 --> 30:26.000
to fight any of you for power or profit.

30:26.830 --> 30:27.720
Yet you all

30:27.880 --> 30:30.640
feared I would
seize the main family estate

30:31.240 --> 30:34.110
and overshadow Li Zhengyou,
the legitimate heir of the main line,

30:34.110 --> 30:36.400
so you kept forcing me
into a corner time and again.

30:36.400 --> 30:38.130
I've endured this long enough.

30:38.200 --> 30:39.800
I won't endure it any longer.

30:43.750 --> 30:45.010
Seventh Grandmother,

30:45.790 --> 30:47.200
thanks to your kindness,

30:47.990 --> 30:50.390
I was able to study
at the Li's Ink Workshop,

30:50.720 --> 30:52.780
and I will always be deeply grateful.

30:56.440 --> 30:57.840
I told them off one by one.

30:58.400 --> 30:59.400
I'm afraid

31:00.720 --> 31:01.680
I cannot sign it.

31:10.310 --> 31:11.570
Seventh Grandmother,

31:12.680 --> 31:14.340
please take care of yourself.

31:27.070 --> 31:28.400
Listen well, all of you.

31:29.400 --> 31:31.270
You are not driving me away today—

31:31.790 --> 31:33.070
I, Li Zhen,

31:33.440 --> 31:35.550
simply refuse to keep company
with the likes of you,

31:35.550 --> 31:37.640
want no part in your filthy schemes,

31:38.290 --> 31:40.460
nor wish to remain among people

31:40.490 --> 31:41.950
who twist right and wrong.

31:42.480 --> 31:43.740
From this day forward,

31:44.110 --> 31:46.160
I, Li Zhen, will have nothing whatsoever

31:46.160 --> 31:47.830
to do with the Li family.

32:17.860 --> 32:19.710
[He Garden]

32:47.160 --> 32:47.960
I'm back.

32:47.960 --> 32:49.070
Zhen is back.

32:49.550 --> 32:50.200
Look,

32:50.530 --> 32:52.860
I've made all your favorite dishes today.

32:53.880 --> 32:54.680
Mother,

32:54.960 --> 32:56.690
how is the mandarin fish so big?

32:57.160 --> 32:58.400
Your grandfather

32:58.480 --> 32:59.750
bought it especially for you.

32:59.750 --> 33:00.790
It's still fresh.

33:01.400 --> 33:02.400
Go rest for a bit—

33:02.400 --> 33:03.550
dinner will be ready soon.

33:03.550 --> 33:04.350
Go ahead.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.070
What's the occasion today?

33:11.070 --> 33:12.800
Why did you cook so many dishes?

33:13.480 --> 33:15.790
Your grandfather said you've been working
so hard these past few months,

33:15.790 --> 33:17.270
and you've really lost weight.

33:17.270 --> 33:18.680
So he didn't just buy the fish—

33:18.680 --> 33:20.590
he also had us prepare this meal

33:20.590 --> 33:23.050
to help you recover
and build your strength.

33:25.070 --> 33:26.330
Thanks, Grandfather.

33:28.200 --> 33:29.640
Zhen, eat more of this fish.

33:29.640 --> 33:31.000
Your grandfather bought it
especially for you.

33:31.000 --> 33:32.240
Come on, eat more.

33:33.920 --> 33:34.780
Have some more.

33:38.830 --> 33:40.160
Everyone already knows

33:40.510 --> 33:42.240
about the ink recipe incident.

33:44.920 --> 33:46.590
It's all over the streets.

33:46.920 --> 33:48.850
You'd have to be deaf
not to hear it.

33:49.960 --> 33:51.220
Those Li family people

33:51.510 --> 33:52.770
are truly despicable.

33:54.640 --> 33:55.880
Mother, don't worry.

33:56.000 --> 33:57.260
Today at the Li family,

33:57.480 --> 33:59.030
I gave them
a piece of my mind one by one.

33:59.030 --> 34:00.400
I didn't suffer any loss.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.240
Good.

34:02.200 --> 34:03.590
I've always told you—

34:03.660 --> 34:04.450
when you come home,

34:04.450 --> 34:06.530
I'll have hot food waiting for you.

34:07.110 --> 34:08.110
But out there,

34:08.110 --> 34:10.070
no matter what happens,
you must protect yourself.

34:10.070 --> 34:12.130
Don't ever let anyone push us around.

34:20.760 --> 34:21.560
Grandfather,

34:22.550 --> 34:23.760
I've returned the contract

34:23.760 --> 34:25.400
Seventh Grandmother gave me.

34:25.400 --> 34:26.800
Since the Li family doesn't welcome me,

34:26.800 --> 34:28.530
there's no point in me staying.

34:28.590 --> 34:29.440
Zhen,

34:30.230 --> 34:32.400
you've been working
on the ancient lacquer-soot ink

34:32.400 --> 34:34.929
these past few months—
you must be exhausted.

34:35.110 --> 34:35.920
Why not

34:36.400 --> 34:37.510
take this chance

34:38.120 --> 34:39.250
to rest properly?

34:39.360 --> 34:40.070
Yes,

34:40.320 --> 34:41.440
listen to your grandfather.

34:41.440 --> 34:42.710
Get some good rest.

34:43.710 --> 34:45.070
I don't want to rest.

34:46.150 --> 34:48.070
Even though I've left the Li family,

34:48.070 --> 34:49.070
my determination to make ink

34:49.070 --> 34:50.330
hasn't changed at all.

34:51.360 --> 34:52.190
Rather than

34:52.320 --> 34:54.150
working in someone else's ink workshop

34:54.150 --> 34:55.760
and living under their scrutiny

34:55.760 --> 34:56.920
and control,

34:58.320 --> 34:59.360
I'd rather

34:59.840 --> 35:01.070
be my own master.

35:01.400 --> 35:02.530
I've made up my mind—

35:03.320 --> 35:04.920
I want to use
the hundred taels of prize money

35:04.920 --> 35:06.150
from Master Qi

35:06.670 --> 35:08.200
to open my own ink workshop.

35:14.710 --> 35:15.910
Open an ink workshop?

35:16.360 --> 35:18.320
Yes. One that belongs to us—

35:18.920 --> 35:20.380
the New Li's Ink Workshop.

35:30.190 --> 35:31.000
Zhen,

35:32.630 --> 35:34.070
opening a workshop

35:34.760 --> 35:36.550
It's not as easy as you think.

35:38.400 --> 35:39.230
Grandfather,

35:39.880 --> 35:41.630
I know it's difficult.

35:42.880 --> 35:44.590
But where there's a will, there's a way.

35:44.590 --> 35:45.590
If I have the skill

35:45.590 --> 35:46.880
and give it my all,

35:47.000 --> 35:48.280
why wouldn't I succeed?

35:48.280 --> 35:50.110
You've only been learning ink-making
for a few years,

35:50.110 --> 35:52.310
and you're already speaking so boldly?

36:02.880 --> 36:03.680
Grandfather,

36:05.510 --> 36:06.360
do you think I'm not capable

36:06.360 --> 36:08.030
of opening this ink workshop?

36:09.550 --> 36:11.030
Or is it that, deep down,

36:13.000 --> 36:14.860
you don't want me to open it at all?

36:57.110 --> 36:57.910
Grandfather,

36:59.280 --> 37:01.680
let's have a proper talk,
just the two of us.

37:01.840 --> 37:03.040
Please open the door.

37:07.000 --> 37:08.000
It's alright—

37:08.440 --> 37:09.480
even if you don't,

37:10.000 --> 37:11.730
I'll just stand here and say it.

37:15.400 --> 37:16.670
In truth,

37:17.840 --> 37:21.510
what you've always held onto in your heart
is still the main family.

37:21.510 --> 37:23.640
You still want me to go back, don't you?

37:25.000 --> 37:25.760
I know

37:26.710 --> 37:29.670
you've always hoped I would return
to the orthodox Li Ink lineage.

37:29.670 --> 37:32.530
But during these past few months
in the main family,

37:32.840 --> 37:34.800
what I saw was nothing
but a house in disarray,

37:34.800 --> 37:36.960
with everyone
harboring their own schemes.

37:36.960 --> 37:38.000
A family

37:38.320 --> 37:40.360
that should have worked together in unity

37:40.360 --> 37:41.440
has been

37:41.550 --> 37:43.750
reduced to suspicion and calculation.

37:44.110 --> 37:46.640
I don't want to be part
of such a Li Ink anymore.

37:47.710 --> 37:48.760
All these years,

37:49.400 --> 37:50.840
apart from Seventh Grandmother

37:50.840 --> 37:52.920
and Eldest Aunt,
who truly stood by me,

37:52.920 --> 37:55.280
The others are still the same.

37:57.150 --> 37:58.800
As long as I remain there,

37:59.960 --> 38:02.590
things like this—
being framed through ink recipe leaks,

38:02.590 --> 38:03.880
being hurt—

38:04.070 --> 38:05.630
will happen again.

38:06.440 --> 38:08.550
They never treated me as family,

38:08.670 --> 38:10.760
so why should I treat them as family?

38:11.000 --> 38:13.150
That Li Ink is not worth holding onto.

38:15.670 --> 38:16.590
Grandfather,

38:18.630 --> 38:21.490
I only want to make
my own New Li's Ink Workshop well.

38:22.070 --> 38:23.150
From now on,

38:23.510 --> 38:25.770
our family will live properly together,

38:26.150 --> 38:26.840
steadily and peacefully—

38:26.840 --> 38:29.000
that will be enough.

38:32.280 --> 38:33.110
I know

38:35.190 --> 38:37.150
you may not understand this yet,

38:38.990 --> 38:40.110
but no matter what,

38:41.280 --> 38:42.880
whether you accept it or not,

38:43.480 --> 38:45.140
whether you forgive me or not,

38:46.230 --> 38:47.510
I am going to open

38:49.000 --> 38:50.530
this New Li's Ink Workshop.

38:55.350 --> 38:58.830
[Deep as the sea, kinship entwined]

39:44.670 --> 39:45.440
Xiao Qi,

39:45.920 --> 39:46.880
what are you looking at?

39:46.880 --> 39:47.630
Master,

39:48.000 --> 39:50.550
I just saw Miss Li Zhen
walking past over there.

39:50.550 --> 39:53.280
It looked like she was asking
about shop rentals.

39:53.670 --> 39:56.730
Don't tell me she's planning
to start her own business?

39:58.440 --> 39:59.880
Miss Li Zhen…

40:02.960 --> 40:03.670
Master,

40:04.360 --> 40:07.190
you've been paying quite
a lot of attention to her lately.

40:07.190 --> 40:09.320
Why don't we be generous this time

40:09.480 --> 40:10.940
and invest in her venture?

40:12.190 --> 40:12.710
Fine.

40:12.920 --> 40:14.650
I'll use your salary to invest.

40:15.960 --> 40:17.880
Master, that won't do!

40:19.630 --> 40:20.760
Zhen, you're back.

40:23.960 --> 40:24.590
-Father.
-Grandfather.

40:24.590 --> 40:25.760
You don't need to leave in such a hurry—

40:25.760 --> 40:27.590
we can wait until Zhen returns
and discuss it properly,

40:27.590 --> 40:28.590
-Okay?
-Mother.

40:29.230 --> 40:30.030
Grandfather.

40:30.400 --> 40:31.130
Zhengliang.

40:37.190 --> 40:37.840
Mother.

40:38.850 --> 40:42.110
I've already rented the shop
for the New Li's Ink Workshop.

40:55.590 --> 40:56.440
Grandfather,

40:57.550 --> 40:59.880
where are you going with your bags packed?

41:00.880 --> 41:01.710
Zhengliang,

41:02.070 --> 41:03.280
hurry and pack.

41:03.670 --> 41:04.710
We're leaving right away.

41:04.710 --> 41:05.550
Grandfather...

41:05.550 --> 41:06.320
Hurry.

41:15.590 --> 41:17.150
A few days ago,
didn't your uncle in Wuyuan

41:17.150 --> 41:18.230
say he wanted to take your eldest brother

41:18.230 --> 41:19.630
to do inkstone business?

41:19.760 --> 41:21.670
When your grandfather
heard your brother wanted to go,

41:21.670 --> 41:23.070
he immediately packed up

41:23.150 --> 41:24.960
and insisted on going with him.

41:25.400 --> 41:26.550
Your brother, his wife, and I

41:26.550 --> 41:27.920
have tried persuading him all morning,

41:27.920 --> 41:29.480
but he won't listen at all.

41:30.360 --> 41:32.490
Please, say something to him quickly.

41:37.150 --> 41:38.920
Father, look,

41:38.920 --> 41:41.360
if you want to go,
there's no need to rush.

41:41.480 --> 41:43.070
Wait a few days
until I've arranged everything properly,

41:43.070 --> 41:45.000
then you can set off. Alright?

41:51.360 --> 41:51.760
Grandfather…

41:51.760 --> 41:52.590
Zhengliang.

41:53.760 --> 41:54.510
Hurry up.

42:01.150 --> 42:01.960
Zhen,

42:02.280 --> 42:03.070
you know

42:03.070 --> 42:03.880
what your grandfather is like.

42:03.880 --> 42:05.680
Don't dig in your heels with him—

42:06.280 --> 42:08.480
his health can't handle a long trip.

42:09.280 --> 42:10.550
This is for Grandfather.

42:10.550 --> 42:11.750
Make sure he takes it.

42:17.880 --> 42:19.210
Mother, we're leaving.

42:19.490 --> 42:20.320
Zhengliang! Zhengliang!

42:20.320 --> 42:21.000
Take this. Take this.

42:21.000 --> 42:22.480
Zhen got this for Grandfather.

42:22.480 --> 42:22.960
Okay.

42:22.960 --> 42:24.220
Be careful on the road.

42:35.150 --> 42:36.480
Zhengliang, Qiu'e,

42:36.510 --> 42:37.710
take good care of your grandfather.

42:37.710 --> 42:38.590
We will, Mother.

42:38.590 --> 42:40.520
Mother, take care of yourself too.

42:41.320 --> 42:41.920
Let's go.
